WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:17.130
Fei is pretty well-known around here.

00:17.830 --> 00:19.160
Must be a tough one, huh?

00:19.440 --> 00:19.830
He is.

00:21.350 --> 00:23.350
Everyone in Sanjiangkou knows him.

00:24.070 --> 00:24.670
Back then,

00:25.350 --> 00:27.950
he tried to rob an armored truck
all by himself.

02:23.610 --> 02:27.440
[Born with Luck]

02:27.470 --> 02:30.370
[Episode 5]

02:40.960 --> 02:42.590
Hello, Li Penggai.

02:43.240 --> 02:45.470
I need you to handle something—
make it clean.

02:45.470 --> 02:47.030
Go to Fei's place

02:47.030 --> 02:49.690
and bring back the hard drive
from his computer.

04:08.590 --> 04:12.580
[Police]

04:22.920 --> 04:23.920
This is the place.

04:25.600 --> 04:26.800
You two keep watch here.

04:26.800 --> 04:27.330
Yes, sir.

05:00.190 --> 05:00.850
Yu Xiaofei,

05:02.390 --> 05:02.890
open up.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.430
Police.

05:07.410 --> 05:07.980
Yu Xia—

05:20.360 --> 05:21.560
Someone's been here.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.440
Is this the only gate?

05:38.920 --> 05:39.750
I'm not sure.

05:40.680 --> 05:42.000
Alright, you stay here
and keep watch.

05:42.000 --> 05:42.680
I'll check around.

05:42.680 --> 05:43.190
Be careful.

05:43.190 --> 05:43.680
Got it.

05:46.020 --> 05:49.490
[Police]

06:25.040 --> 06:25.960
Stop! Police!

06:26.500 --> 06:27.780
♪ He ♪

06:29.250 --> 06:33.490
♪ A rusted flower etched
across his chest ♪

06:29.600 --> 06:30.190
A suspicious person

06:30.190 --> 06:31.540
just ran out of Fei's apartment.

06:31.540 --> 06:32.400
I'm in pursuit—

06:32.750 --> 06:33.880
requesting backup!

06:35.540 --> 06:36.510
♪ Oh, he ♪

06:35.750 --> 06:37.280
Song Xing, what's going on?

06:38.340 --> 06:41.420
♪ Says your worldview's still too small ♪

06:38.680 --> 06:39.610
I don't know.

06:40.320 --> 06:42.380
I'm heading west of Fei's apartment.

06:44.060 --> 06:44.970
Your location?

06:45.470 --> 06:49.320
♪ A rat that steals rice—
humans call it cunning ♪

06:45.720 --> 06:46.270
I turned.

06:48.920 --> 06:49.780
I turned again.

06:49.970 --> 06:53.950
♪ A human who steals honey—
calls the bees hardworking ♪

06:54.540 --> 06:58.490
♪ Absurd, greedy—
self-proclaimed superior beings ♪

06:54.930 --> 06:55.470
Stop!

06:57.720 --> 06:58.380
Stop there!

06:59.050 --> 07:03.600
♪ Hypocritical, wasteful, hollow—
this gaudy human race ♪

06:59.560 --> 07:00.120
Police!

07:02.240 --> 07:03.240
Stop right there!

07:07.120 --> 07:08.220
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

07:11.930 --> 07:12.880
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

07:19.120 --> 07:25.480
[Everlasting Legacy]

07:51.680 --> 07:52.560
What are you doing?

07:52.560 --> 07:53.430
Sorry about that.

07:53.430 --> 07:54.200
"Sorry"?

07:54.360 --> 07:55.420
Watch it next time!

07:58.000 --> 08:00.390
You've completely messed up
the money count—

08:00.390 --> 08:01.160
what is this?

08:04.000 --> 08:04.930
Where is the guy?

08:16.410 --> 08:22.950
[Police]

08:20.270 --> 08:21.000
How did it go?

08:21.040 --> 08:21.970
Where is the guy?

08:22.190 --> 08:22.850
He got away.

08:23.480 --> 08:24.040
Got away...

08:24.040 --> 08:25.040
Was it Yu Xiaofei?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.270
I didn't get a clear look.

08:28.270 --> 08:29.220
How could you not see him clearly?

08:29.220 --> 08:30.820
Did he have a scar on his face?

08:30.950 --> 08:31.920
He was running in front of me
the whole time—

08:31.920 --> 08:33.049
I never saw his face.

08:33.600 --> 08:34.080
In front...

08:34.080 --> 08:35.440
You were chasing him

08:35.549 --> 08:37.150
and didn't even see his face?

08:37.870 --> 08:38.799
That's on me too.

08:39.720 --> 08:41.320
It has nothing to do with you.

08:41.480 --> 08:43.270
-Listen, Song Xing, you really—
-No, no.

08:43.270 --> 08:44.590
let's quickly

08:44.720 --> 08:45.910
contact nearby police stations.

08:45.910 --> 08:46.910
See if any cameras

08:46.910 --> 08:48.030
caught the suspect's face,

08:48.030 --> 08:48.560
alright?

08:50.150 --> 08:50.690
Looks like

08:50.690 --> 08:52.290
we've already alerted them.

08:58.480 --> 08:58.880
Ren.

08:58.910 --> 08:59.270
Ren.

08:59.320 --> 08:59.600
Ren.

08:59.600 --> 09:01.530
Hurry, hurry—carry it out of here!

09:15.040 --> 09:15.720
Mr. Rong.

09:16.990 --> 09:17.960
Is it done?

09:19.670 --> 09:20.670
It's done, but...

09:23.150 --> 09:23.960
Go on.

09:25.550 --> 09:26.080
Li Penggai ran

09:26.080 --> 09:27.550
into the police

09:27.910 --> 09:29.640
when he came out of Fei's place.

09:30.910 --> 09:32.040
Li Penggai got caught?

09:32.040 --> 09:32.840
No, he didn't.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.210
He was fast enough.

09:34.360 --> 09:35.820
We also got the hard drive.

09:38.240 --> 09:39.550
Tell him to lay low for the next few days—

09:39.550 --> 09:41.280
don't go out unless necessary.

09:41.950 --> 09:42.630
Don't worry.

09:42.630 --> 09:44.440
The police can't trace it back to us now.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.870
And even if they do,

09:45.890 --> 09:47.290
they've got no evidence.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.270
I've said it many times—

09:48.270 --> 09:49.630
we're a legitimate company,

09:49.630 --> 09:50.190
alright?

09:50.510 --> 09:51.550
We just don't want this kind of thing

09:51.550 --> 09:53.240
spilling over into Rongcheng Group.

09:53.240 --> 09:53.670
Got it.

09:54.390 --> 09:55.150
Also,

09:55.840 --> 09:56.790
how's your contact

09:56.790 --> 09:57.750
with Fang Yong,

09:57.790 --> 09:58.750
the Director

09:58.750 --> 10:00.380
of the East New Town
Administrative Committee?

10:00.380 --> 10:05.410
[Prosperity Flows Like Water]

10:00.480 --> 10:01.360
We can't win the bid

10:01.360 --> 10:02.560
without his support.

10:04.440 --> 10:05.570
That's a bit tricky.

10:07.240 --> 10:08.570
What's tricky about it?

10:10.870 --> 10:12.080
Fang Yong

10:12.200 --> 10:18.980
[Prosperity Flows Like Water]

10:12.270 --> 10:13.460
is very principled—

10:13.480 --> 10:15.480
a well-known model
of integrity in governance.

10:15.480 --> 10:17.320
He doesn't accept gifts,
and doesn't attend banquets.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.960
He's extremely frugal.

10:19.120 --> 10:21.390
The office provides him
with a car and driver,

10:21.390 --> 10:22.360
but he refuses both,

10:22.360 --> 10:24.080
saying it's to save public funds.

10:24.080 --> 10:25.000
He cycles

10:25.000 --> 10:26.120
to work every day.

10:26.200 --> 10:28.390
He donates his salary and allowances

10:28.550 --> 10:30.630
to welfare organizations every month,

10:30.630 --> 10:31.960
and he's been featured multiple times

10:31.960 --> 10:33.320
on provincial TV and newspapers.

10:33.320 --> 10:34.550
On the surface, no one would even think

10:34.550 --> 10:37.080
he's the decision-maker
of the East New Town.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.120
Does he...

10:38.440 --> 10:39.720
have any hobbies?

10:41.670 --> 10:43.380
He'/s widely regarded as a man of culture—

10:43.380 --> 10:45.310
more precisely, a poet.

10:45.600 --> 10:46.750
He occasionally

10:47.670 --> 10:48.670
publishes poetry

10:48.790 --> 10:50.790
and has even released a collection.

10:52.800 --> 10:54.490
Then we go with what he likes.

10:53.910 --> 10:54.510
[A Collection of Classic Jokes]

10:56.870 --> 10:57.720
Don't worry.

10:58.320 --> 11:00.920
Yibo is already
looking for suitable options.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.080
Looking for what?

11:02.080 --> 11:03.960
We're catering to his preferences.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.240
What man of that age

11:05.270 --> 11:07.200
doesn't have an eye for the ladies?

11:07.550 --> 11:09.120
Especially, he's divorced.

11:09.120 --> 11:09.870
Vulgar.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.840
If you're dealing with a man of culture,

11:11.840 --> 11:12.910
use a cultured approach.

11:12.910 --> 11:13.510
Got it?

11:13.870 --> 11:15.440
He's going to be our golden goose—

11:15.440 --> 11:16.360
we should be burning incense

11:16.360 --> 11:17.360
and worshipping him,

11:17.360 --> 11:18.190
understand?

11:20.480 --> 11:21.150
Vulgar?

11:25.630 --> 11:26.120
Fine.

11:31.610 --> 11:32.830
[Fang Yong, Director of the
East New Town Administrative Committee]

11:32.830 --> 11:34.830
[Sanjiangkou City, Ping'an Province]

11:34.830 --> 11:35.910
[Latest News on Fang Yong]

11:35.930 --> 11:37.330
[Fang Yong's Cultural Struggle]

11:45.270 --> 11:46.480
I didn't expect you

11:46.480 --> 11:47.670
to be such a gaming nerd back in the day.

11:47.670 --> 11:49.000
Before I started working,

11:49.000 --> 11:49.960
I was the top mage

11:49.980 --> 11:50.860
in our guild.

11:51.320 --> 11:53.000
Our guild leader really valued me a lot.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.320
And he was loaded.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.550
How loaded?

11:57.080 --> 11:58.940
Worth making him our next target?

11:59.000 --> 11:59.930
What's his name?

12:01.030 --> 12:02.830
Damn, wasted my ultimate skill.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.390
I don't even know his real name—

12:04.390 --> 12:06.120
his username was "Bo Loves Qi."

12:15.710 --> 12:16.150
Bro,

12:16.750 --> 12:17.750
why don't we just search

12:17.750 --> 12:19.030
"East New Town Administrative Committee"

12:19.030 --> 12:19.630
directly?

12:20.200 --> 12:21.960
Fang Yong has to go to work, right?

12:21.960 --> 12:24.690
We'll definitely find him there
sooner or later.

12:26.320 --> 12:27.120
Could you be any louder?

12:27.120 --> 12:28.150
The whole Sanjiangkou's

12:28.150 --> 12:29.010
gonna hear you.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.270
Bro,

12:33.390 --> 12:34.250
no one heard me.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.480
Are the noodles cooked yet?

12:40.480 --> 12:41.410
Still a bit hard.

12:41.440 --> 12:42.170
You know why?

12:42.600 --> 12:43.260
Why?

12:43.550 --> 12:45.200
Because you're too impatient.

12:45.200 --> 12:47.240
The water isn't boiling yet—
so the noodles won't cook.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.440
The road to success

12:48.440 --> 12:50.550
requires waiting for the right timing.

12:50.550 --> 12:52.210
Finding Fang Yong isn't hard.

12:52.390 --> 12:53.320
What's hard

12:53.320 --> 12:55.120
is finding evidence that he's corrupt.

12:55.120 --> 12:55.920
Don't rush it.

12:58.030 --> 12:58.870
Fair point.

13:00.270 --> 13:02.200
So how do we find the evidence, bro?

13:05.100 --> 13:06.200
[Newsroom Address: No. 337, Xinwen Road,
Sanjiangkou City]

13:06.220 --> 13:06.950
[Sanjiangkou Evening News Building]

13:09.470 --> 13:10.010
[Sanjiangkou Evening News]

13:10.040 --> 13:11.350
[Newsroom Address: No. 337, Xinwen Road,
Sanjiangkou City]

13:11.370 --> 13:12.490
[Sanjiangkou Evening News Building]

13:13.500 --> 13:14.110
Recently,

13:14.690 --> 13:16.160
officers from our

13:15.750 --> 13:20.900
[Press Conference]

13:16.320 --> 13:17.630
city Public Security Bureau

13:17.630 --> 13:19.560
successfully solved a major case.

13:24.520 --> 13:26.870
After days and nights
of relentless effort,

13:26.870 --> 13:28.040
they arrested Li,

13:28.360 --> 13:29.020
the suspect

13:29.480 --> 13:30.120
in a major

13:30.960 --> 13:32.200
interprovincial

13:32.270 --> 13:33.600
serial murder case,

13:34.440 --> 13:35.440
and immediately carried out

13:35.440 --> 13:37.700
an intensive overnight interrogation.

13:39.790 --> 13:40.610
Through

13:40.720 --> 13:43.270
meticulous investigation

13:43.510 --> 13:45.110
and step-by-step analysis,

13:48.720 --> 13:50.670
police gradually unraveled the case,

13:50.670 --> 13:52.000
and Li eventually confessed

13:52.000 --> 13:53.550
to all his crimes.

13:53.630 --> 13:59.310
[Press Conference]

13:57.550 --> 13:58.120
Sorry.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.970
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

14:02.120 --> 14:04.550
I need to take a call
from the provincial authorities.

14:04.550 --> 14:05.080
Alright.

14:06.020 --> 14:08.560
[Press Conference]

14:07.670 --> 14:08.610
Journalists,

14:09.000 --> 14:09.550
Chief Zhang

14:09.550 --> 14:10.790
needs to take

14:10.790 --> 14:12.120
an important work call.

14:12.360 --> 14:12.750
If you

14:12.750 --> 14:13.870
still have questions,

14:13.870 --> 14:14.690
Captain Wang

14:14.960 --> 14:16.150
will answer them.

14:23.030 --> 14:23.750
Hello, Mentor.

14:23.750 --> 14:24.550
Zhang Yi'ang,

14:25.120 --> 14:26.750
capturing Li Feng
and cracking such a major case

14:26.750 --> 14:28.150
is no small achievement—

14:28.440 --> 14:29.270
you did well.

14:30.390 --> 14:31.700
But don't get cocky.

14:32.320 --> 14:33.520
Don't worry, I won't.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.760
Everything I've achieved today

14:36.030 --> 14:36.790
is because I've always remembered

14:36.790 --> 14:38.090
what you told me:

14:39.510 --> 14:40.330
a people's police officer

14:40.330 --> 14:41.730
must be on the front line.

14:42.440 --> 14:44.630
Like the small tide
that stirs great waves,

14:44.630 --> 14:45.270
and the roc that spreads its wings—

14:45.270 --> 14:46.440
Alright, alright—enough.

14:46.440 --> 14:46.960
Stop

14:46.960 --> 14:48.020
talking nonsense.

14:49.030 --> 14:50.790
Mentor, since I've made this arrest

14:50.790 --> 14:52.160
and earned some merit,

14:52.630 --> 14:55.670
can I be transferred back
to the Provincial Department?

14:55.670 --> 14:56.670
Weren't you just saying

14:56.670 --> 14:58.360
you wanted to be on the front line?

14:58.360 --> 14:59.630
Weren't you talking about tides and rocs?

14:59.630 --> 15:01.960
And now you've changed your mind already?

15:02.000 --> 15:02.800
Zhang Yi'ang,

15:03.480 --> 15:05.080
Sanjiangkou is a small city.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.400
Two officers

15:06.440 --> 15:08.300
have been killed within 6 months.

15:08.840 --> 15:09.770
Statistically,

15:09.790 --> 15:11.200
that's no coincidence.

15:12.390 --> 15:13.840
There must be some connection

15:13.840 --> 15:15.440
between these 2 cases.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.140
Follow this line of thinking—

15:19.270 --> 15:20.360
don't overlook

15:20.510 --> 15:21.520
any suspicion.

15:21.840 --> 15:22.510
Remember this—

15:22.510 --> 15:23.630
you must get

15:23.630 --> 15:24.830
to the bottom of this.

15:25.150 --> 15:25.880
Understand?

15:26.270 --> 15:27.000
Understood.

15:31.350 --> 15:40.150
[Police]

15:40.970 --> 15:43.320
[Police]

15:44.170 --> 15:44.790
Chief,

15:44.910 --> 15:46.040
I've figured it out.

15:47.390 --> 15:47.870
What...

15:48.510 --> 15:49.570
what are you doing?

15:51.390 --> 15:52.390
Did you hear that?

15:53.440 --> 15:54.030
You said something?

15:54.030 --> 15:55.290
I didn't say anything.

15:55.320 --> 15:57.380
It just went "crack." Did you hear it?

15:57.910 --> 15:58.630
This is bad...

15:58.630 --> 15:59.690
this is really bad.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.770
I didn't hear anything.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.360
It's fine. What were you saying?

16:06.360 --> 16:07.200
Before Captain Ye

16:07.200 --> 16:08.150
was killed,

16:08.240 --> 16:09.970
why did he write down your name?

16:11.240 --> 16:12.120
Even when

16:12.720 --> 16:14.720
someone knows they're about to die,

16:15.270 --> 16:17.330
they instinctively call for help...

16:17.670 --> 16:19.420
or try to stop the bleeding.

16:19.750 --> 16:21.280
But Captain Ye did neither.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.900
In his final moment,

16:24.150 --> 16:25.550
he still wrote your name.

16:26.750 --> 16:27.320
Why?

16:29.750 --> 16:30.270
Why?

16:31.000 --> 16:32.200
You must have

16:32.200 --> 16:34.800
uncovered a key lead
in Chief Lu's murder case.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.530
Maybe you didn't even realize it—

16:36.530 --> 16:38.270
but there was definitely something.

16:38.270 --> 16:39.730
Captain Ye noticed it too,

16:40.320 --> 16:42.180
and he was silenced because of it.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.150
He wrote your name

16:45.630 --> 16:46.630
because you're the only one

16:46.630 --> 16:47.960
who can solve this case.

16:48.150 --> 16:48.670
Chief.

16:50.120 --> 16:52.240
Right now... I'm afraid my hands are tied.

16:52.240 --> 16:52.910
Why?

16:53.790 --> 16:54.750
Just a second

16:54.790 --> 16:55.850
before you came in,

16:56.720 --> 16:57.790
this injured spot

16:57.840 --> 16:58.970
got hit badly again.

17:00.150 --> 17:00.750
I told you,

17:00.750 --> 17:02.480
the hospitals here aren't reliable.

17:02.480 --> 17:04.510
Then let's try another hospital.

17:05.349 --> 17:06.069
Li Qian,

17:07.069 --> 17:07.829
it looks like you're going to

17:07.829 --> 17:09.290
have to handle this alone.

17:12.849 --> 17:17.160
[Sanjiangkou Evening News]

17:13.440 --> 17:14.640
Time to eat. Let's go.

17:14.859 --> 17:15.750
Finally, I'm off work.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.030
I'm exhausted—it's been a long morning.

17:17.030 --> 17:18.550
What did you eat earlier today?

17:18.550 --> 17:19.069
I'm starving.

17:19.069 --> 17:20.720
I'll grab a bowl of noodles first.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.310
Eat more.

17:21.440 --> 17:23.440
There's still work this afternoon.

17:27.950 --> 17:34.750
[Sanjiangkou Evening News]

17:28.109 --> 17:28.690
Sir,

17:28.720 --> 17:30.320
we left a power drill behind.

17:30.510 --> 17:31.480
A power drill?

17:33.920 --> 17:34.650
Come with me.

17:41.750 --> 17:44.810
[7th Floor – News Department]

17:53.630 --> 17:56.110
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

17:53.750 --> 18:01.630
[News Department]

17:57.140 --> 17:58.400
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

17:59.890 --> 18:02.300
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

18:03.180 --> 18:04.620
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

18:05.730 --> 18:06.540
♪ Oh Gimme ♪

18:07.760 --> 18:09.600
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

18:10.770 --> 18:12.290
♪ Raining make it rain ♪

18:12.830 --> 18:15.550
♪ Oh cash is my revolution ♪

18:25.630 --> 18:27.290
Everything's under control.

18:27.640 --> 18:28.300
Get to work.

18:29.960 --> 18:31.620
What kind of work are we doing?

18:33.200 --> 18:34.080
Roach control.

18:36.750 --> 18:37.640
Roach control?

18:38.510 --> 18:40.160
I didn't hear anything about that.

18:40.160 --> 18:40.890
Let me check.

18:47.860 --> 18:49.120
Let me do it. I'll do it.

19:06.710 --> 19:08.500
Do you have Plan B?

19:08.720 --> 19:10.250
Plan B in your dream.

19:10.820 --> 19:12.880
Hello, is this the Logistics office?

19:14.270 --> 19:14.830
I'm just checking—

19:14.830 --> 19:16.830
did we schedule anyone to come over—

19:19.060 --> 19:20.320
It's here! Here! Here!

19:21.310 --> 19:22.040
A cockroach!

19:22.110 --> 19:23.000
Move! Move!

19:29.790 --> 19:30.680
Keep watch outside.

19:30.680 --> 19:31.330
They'll be back

19:31.330 --> 19:32.330
from lunch at 1 PM.

19:32.630 --> 19:34.430
I'll try my best to do it quickly.

19:35.930 --> 19:36.990
What are you doing?

19:37.270 --> 19:37.960
I just want to know

19:37.960 --> 19:39.200
what we're actually here for today.

19:39.200 --> 19:40.320
To work.

19:40.350 --> 19:41.750
Go keep watch at the door.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.580
[Sanjiangkou Exclusive Interview
Press Release]

19:50.600 --> 19:53.230
[Exclusive Interview Press Release:
Fang Yong]

19:53.250 --> 19:53.680
[My Poetry, My Faraway]

20:23.830 --> 20:25.630
Bro, what exactly are you doing?

20:25.680 --> 20:26.940
It's 12:50 PM already.

20:27.680 --> 20:28.480
Almost done.

20:32.670 --> 20:33.830
Hey, why are you staring at me?

20:33.830 --> 20:34.720
Watch the elevator—

20:34.720 --> 20:35.460
tell me if anyone comes.

20:35.460 --> 20:36.240
Alright.

20:39.410 --> 20:42.390
[Copying...]

20:42.530 --> 20:44.750
[From Press Release to Drive E]

20:56.270 --> 20:57.130
Please come in.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.270
Chief Qi,

20:59.960 --> 21:01.960
Chief Zhang wants to speak with you.

21:02.830 --> 21:03.490
Where is he?

21:08.480 --> 21:09.070
Chief Qi.

21:10.790 --> 21:12.000
W-What happened to you?

21:12.000 --> 21:12.350
I...

21:12.350 --> 21:13.000
How did this...

21:13.000 --> 21:13.720
You were fine just now—

21:13.720 --> 21:14.920
how did you end up in a wheelchair?

21:14.920 --> 21:15.310
No idea.

21:15.310 --> 21:16.310
It just happened.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.350
I was fine a moment ago—

21:17.350 --> 21:19.400
then my leg just gave out, went "crack,"

21:19.400 --> 21:20.530
and now I can't stand

21:20.590 --> 21:21.480
or walk.

21:21.720 --> 21:22.980
J-Just look at this...

21:24.270 --> 21:25.200
Chief Qi, I'm still a bit worried

21:25.200 --> 21:26.600
about the hospital here.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.920
I think I should go back
to the provincial capital for a check-up.

21:28.920 --> 21:29.980
Alright, alright.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.080
How long will it take?

21:33.110 --> 21:33.830
Hard to say.

21:35.750 --> 21:37.030
The hospital said yesterday

21:37.030 --> 21:38.430
there were no fractures,

21:38.550 --> 21:39.880
but with how it is now...

21:39.880 --> 21:41.110
I don't know if it's neurological

21:41.110 --> 21:42.440
or something deeper.

21:42.440 --> 21:45.170
I need to go back
and get a proper diagnosis first.

21:45.790 --> 21:47.720
Whether it takes a few months or...

21:47.720 --> 21:49.180
It's hard to say right now.

21:51.720 --> 21:52.250
Alright,

21:53.070 --> 21:54.200
health comes first.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.000
Health always comes first.

21:55.000 --> 21:56.530
Actually, I just want to say

21:57.480 --> 21:58.300
I'm sorry.

21:59.000 --> 22:00.000
I haven't been here long,

22:00.000 --> 22:00.830
haven't done much work,

22:00.830 --> 22:02.590
and now I've even gotten injured myself—

22:02.590 --> 22:03.550
sorry for causing trouble.

22:03.550 --> 22:05.080
W-What kind of talk is that?

22:05.160 --> 22:06.350
You've done outstanding work.

22:06.350 --> 22:07.310
I'll arrange

22:07.310 --> 22:08.710
a proper farewell dinner

22:09.000 --> 22:10.230
and treat you well.

22:10.400 --> 22:11.200
No need for dinner.

22:11.200 --> 22:11.960
I just came

22:11.960 --> 22:12.720
to say goodbye.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.510
I'll head back right away.

22:13.510 --> 22:14.030
No, no,

22:14.480 --> 22:16.010
you must attend the dinner.

22:16.230 --> 22:17.490
Tonight after dinner,

22:17.640 --> 22:20.040
I'll personally see you off
to the station.

22:20.270 --> 22:21.000
Is that okay?

22:54.960 --> 22:55.480
Sir.

22:55.790 --> 22:56.200
Sir...

22:57.310 --> 22:58.110
What's wrong?

23:03.720 --> 23:04.780
What's the matter?

23:05.640 --> 23:06.960
W-What happened?

23:07.070 --> 23:07.870
I'm dizzy...

23:08.340 --> 23:09.140
Dizzy, dizzy.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.220
Low blood sugar?

23:09.260 --> 23:10.510
[Copying...]

23:11.290 --> 23:12.160
I've got candy in my room, hold on—

23:12.160 --> 23:12.760
No, no.

23:12.790 --> 23:13.480
Sir, sir,

23:14.110 --> 23:14.880
I, I... Y-You

23:14.880 --> 23:16.200
just press my Zusanli point.

23:16.200 --> 23:16.640
Press it.

23:16.640 --> 23:17.720
Trust me, my family's been

23:17.720 --> 23:18.880
traditional Chinese doctors
for 6 generations.

23:18.880 --> 23:20.010
Just press Zusanli.

23:20.320 --> 23:21.070
Here, here, here.

23:21.070 --> 23:21.600
Zusanli?

23:21.650 --> 23:22.640
Yes, yes, that's the one.

23:22.640 --> 23:23.720
Yes, right here. Here.

23:23.720 --> 23:24.200
That's right.

23:24.200 --> 23:24.590
Better?

23:24.590 --> 23:25.750
Harder... harder...

23:25.750 --> 23:27.610
Still not good—still not good...

23:28.510 --> 23:29.830
Alright, alright.

23:29.830 --> 23:30.510
Better?

23:30.720 --> 23:31.510
I'm good now.

23:31.790 --> 23:32.470
Alright.

23:34.200 --> 23:34.590
It's okay now.

23:34.590 --> 23:35.160
Thank you, Sir.

23:35.160 --> 23:36.110
Thank you, Sir.

23:38.140 --> 23:39.620
What a guy...

23:45.000 --> 23:45.510
Bro...

23:47.310 --> 23:48.150
hey bro—

23:48.270 --> 23:49.980
what acupoint do you press

23:50.070 --> 23:52.200
for chronic intestinal obstruction?

23:54.160 --> 23:54.890
Did you hear?

23:55.000 --> 23:56.200
Chief Zhang is going back
to the provincial capital.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.440
Cut it out. Who told you that?

23:57.440 --> 23:58.040
It's true.

24:03.160 --> 24:04.000
Li Qian...

24:04.970 --> 24:05.830
looks like you're going to

24:05.830 --> 24:07.160
be fighting alone here.

24:08.160 --> 24:08.880
Why is Chief Zhang in such a hurry

24:08.880 --> 24:11.140
to return to the Provincial Department?

24:13.200 --> 24:14.510
During yesterday's DUI checkpoint,

24:14.510 --> 24:16.370
all the ideas were actually mine.

24:16.750 --> 24:17.510
If anything went wrong,

24:17.510 --> 24:19.640
the responsibility should fall on me.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.350
There are a lot of things

24:20.350 --> 24:21.810
I can't tell you right now.

24:21.890 --> 24:23.290
But what I can tell you is—

24:24.240 --> 24:24.920
you did

24:24.920 --> 24:26.050
nothing wrong.

24:26.440 --> 24:27.770
You actually helped me.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.110
So that's what it is...

24:34.110 --> 24:34.790
I get it now.

24:38.160 --> 24:38.790
Chief Qi.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.070
Thank you.

24:41.960 --> 24:43.070
Alright, alright.

24:45.680 --> 24:47.130
I heard Chief Zhang is leaving?

24:47.130 --> 24:48.660
Is his injury that serious?

24:48.920 --> 24:49.370
What's going on?

24:49.370 --> 24:50.700
Chief Qi, Captain Wang—

24:51.070 --> 24:52.530
Chief Zhang cannot leave.

24:53.880 --> 24:55.030
Only he can solve Chief Lu

24:55.030 --> 24:56.360
and Captain Ye's cases.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.110
Be clear.

25:02.000 --> 25:02.810
About

25:03.070 --> 25:04.310
the DUI operation—

25:05.070 --> 25:06.240
the idea of setting checkpoints

25:06.240 --> 25:07.450
at all intersections

25:07.920 --> 25:09.180
wasn't Chief Zhang's,

25:09.750 --> 25:11.480
it was Song Xing's suggestion.

25:11.920 --> 25:13.200
At first, I thought

25:13.720 --> 25:16.010
Chief Zhang was just covering
for Song Xing,

25:16.010 --> 25:17.590
trying to keep him
from being criticized by Captain Wang.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.450
But I was wrong.

25:18.590 --> 25:19.520
What do you mean?

25:20.270 --> 25:21.590
Captain Wang, think about it.

25:21.590 --> 25:23.640
Chief Zhang has been a police officer
for years—

25:23.640 --> 25:24.840
he must know it's rare

25:24.960 --> 25:25.640
to include non-motor vehicles

25:25.640 --> 25:27.400
in DUI checks.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.600
So why did he insist on it?

25:32.350 --> 25:33.310
When Li Feng was arrested,

25:33.310 --> 25:34.030
he said:

25:35.540 --> 25:37.270
"Last night I had a bad feeling.

25:38.960 --> 25:39.920
You even checked non-motor vehicles

25:39.920 --> 25:41.240
during DUI enforcement—

25:41.240 --> 25:42.570
were you coming for me?"

25:43.000 --> 25:44.110
That's impossible.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.910
What, is he some kind of prophet?

25:46.200 --> 25:46.960
Remember

25:47.160 --> 25:48.000
when Chief Zhang was here

25:48.000 --> 25:49.030
personally running point

25:49.030 --> 25:50.000
on the DUI crackdown?

25:50.000 --> 25:51.480
He said, "'One mistake: their tears,

25:51.480 --> 25:52.400
your blood.'

25:53.440 --> 25:55.300
We've got to take this seriously.

25:56.800 --> 26:00.260
You never know, we might even
stumble onto something bigger."

26:02.960 --> 26:05.560
At Li Feng's house...

26:05.880 --> 26:06.790
"When Captain Ye was killed,

26:06.790 --> 26:07.920
this woman delivered food to me,

26:07.920 --> 26:08.320
right?

26:08.400 --> 26:09.500
Now both of them have disappeared—

26:09.500 --> 26:11.110
don't you find that suspicious?"

26:11.110 --> 26:12.000
Chief Qi, I've noticed

26:12.000 --> 26:12.790
Chief Zhang

26:12.830 --> 26:14.230
is extremely observant.

26:16.070 --> 26:17.200
"Someone's been here."

26:17.200 --> 26:18.200
And when Li Feng

26:18.200 --> 26:20.000
admitted he was a wanted criminal,

26:20.000 --> 26:23.000
Chief Zhang was the only one
who remained completely calm.

26:23.000 --> 26:24.300
That's not right.

26:25.590 --> 26:26.440
That's not right at all.

26:26.440 --> 26:26.830
If...

26:27.330 --> 26:29.180
If he's really that capable,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.110
why does he

26:30.110 --> 26:30.960
stay behind the scenes

26:30.960 --> 26:32.400
and let you
and Song Xing do the work?

26:32.400 --> 26:34.120
Chief Zhang used to be

26:34.200 --> 26:36.590
a disciple of Director Gao,
when he was at the Provincial Department.

26:36.590 --> 26:38.240
From the Fengqi Road serial murders

26:38.240 --> 26:39.240
to the White Elephant case—

26:39.240 --> 26:40.840
he's handled 17 major cases.

26:41.310 --> 26:42.640
So this time...

26:43.400 --> 26:43.980
What?

26:46.110 --> 26:47.590
He didn't want to take the spotlight.

26:47.590 --> 26:49.120
Didn't want the spotlight?

26:50.160 --> 26:50.960
Well, that means

26:50.960 --> 26:52.240
he couldn't afford to take it.

26:52.240 --> 26:53.300
But why?

26:54.510 --> 26:55.550
I can answer that.

26:56.460 --> 26:57.750
I just called Yan

26:57.750 --> 26:59.410
at the Provincial Department

26:59.830 --> 27:01.290
to ask about Zhang Yi'ang.

27:02.000 --> 27:02.720
Do you know

27:02.750 --> 27:04.340
why he left the bureau back then?

27:04.340 --> 27:05.100
I heard

27:05.160 --> 27:05.620
it was

27:05.720 --> 27:07.140
during a suspect chase.

27:07.590 --> 27:08.640
He tried to talk the suspect down,

27:08.640 --> 27:10.110
but the man ended up
falling to his death.

27:10.110 --> 27:11.710
There's another version...

27:13.030 --> 27:13.640
-Calm down!
-Back up!

27:13.640 --> 27:14.920
I said put the knife down!

27:14.920 --> 27:15.750
Back off! Back off!

27:15.750 --> 27:16.440
-Calm down.
-Calm down.

27:16.440 --> 27:16.830
Don't move!

27:16.830 --> 27:17.310
Calm down!

27:17.310 --> 27:18.240
Don't come any closer!

27:18.240 --> 27:19.440
-Calm down!
-Don't come over!

27:19.440 --> 27:20.500
Put the knife down!

27:20.590 --> 27:21.200
Quiet!

27:22.350 --> 27:24.410
Don't provoke him—I'll handle this.

27:29.440 --> 27:31.240
Shi Ge is trying to talk you down,

27:31.350 --> 27:32.720
Yu is trying to talk you down,

27:32.720 --> 27:33.640
and I definitely am too...

27:33.640 --> 27:35.440
I don't need you talking me down.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.400
Why are you so talkative?

27:38.790 --> 27:39.550
If those two pieces of lips

27:39.550 --> 27:40.880
on your face move again,

27:41.590 --> 27:42.480
I'll jump right now.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.680
Dying is easy.

27:44.080 --> 27:45.350
I-It doesn't take much resolve.

27:45.350 --> 27:45.960
Take us two

27:45.960 --> 27:47.310
right now—

27:47.310 --> 27:48.970
if I accidentally push you...

27:57.720 --> 27:59.480
The truth about what happened back then—

27:59.480 --> 28:01.480
only the officers on the scene knew.

28:01.790 --> 28:03.010
But afterward,

28:03.400 --> 28:05.130
no one ever mentioned it again.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.590
Anyway, Zhang Yi'ang

28:06.590 --> 28:08.200
was eventually transferred out of CID

28:08.200 --> 28:10.240
and sent to the Veteran Cadre Bureau.

28:10.240 --> 28:11.920
So he became disillusioned

28:12.000 --> 28:13.200
with criminal investigation, huh?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.240
Even if he discovered leads

28:14.240 --> 28:15.480
that we couldn't,

28:15.590 --> 28:16.640
he still wouldn't step forward.

28:16.640 --> 28:17.240
Exactly.

28:17.750 --> 28:18.720
And on top of that,

28:18.720 --> 28:21.450
there were people
giving him attitude every day.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.910
Chief Zhang can't leave.

28:26.200 --> 28:27.700
But his leg is injured

28:27.960 --> 28:29.680
and he needs to go back
to the provincial capital for treatment—

28:29.680 --> 28:30.550
what reason do we have

28:30.550 --> 28:31.270
to stop him?

28:31.550 --> 28:33.750
We'll find any reason we can,
but he has to stay.

28:33.750 --> 28:34.370
How?

28:35.310 --> 28:36.590
Alright, it's fine.

28:36.720 --> 28:37.450
Don't worry.

28:37.590 --> 28:38.510
I'll reach out once I get there.

28:38.510 --> 28:39.040
Alright.

28:39.070 --> 28:39.670
Take care.

28:41.520 --> 28:43.410
[Police]

28:45.550 --> 28:46.480
Where's Li Qian?

28:46.750 --> 28:47.510
I'll go call her.

28:47.510 --> 28:48.110
No need, no need.

28:48.110 --> 28:49.000
Let her keep working.

28:49.000 --> 28:49.720
You all go ahead and do your jobs.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.920
That's totally fine.

28:51.750 --> 28:52.570
Yi'ang,

28:52.640 --> 28:54.030
time was too tight this time.

28:54.030 --> 28:55.160
We should've held

28:55.200 --> 28:56.200
a proper farewell ceremony for you.

28:56.200 --> 28:56.680
No need.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.560
Chief Qi,

28:59.240 --> 29:00.040
Captain Wang,

29:00.480 --> 29:01.550
although we haven't known each other

29:01.550 --> 29:02.360
for long,

29:02.880 --> 29:03.410
I already

29:03.720 --> 29:05.620
feel a deep trust

29:05.750 --> 29:07.260
and bond

29:07.290 --> 29:08.420
with everyone here.

29:11.350 --> 29:12.750
I'd like to recite a poem.

29:14.200 --> 29:14.730
Go ahead.

29:15.110 --> 29:15.920
We'll all

29:16.000 --> 29:17.000
remember it.

29:19.380 --> 29:20.730
"If life deceives you,

29:21.880 --> 29:23.010
do not be distressed

29:23.480 --> 29:24.240
or anxious.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.060
In sorrowful days,

29:27.340 --> 29:28.180
remain calm;

29:29.510 --> 29:31.440
joyful days will surely come."

29:32.070 --> 29:33.380
Chief Zhang!

29:41.770 --> 29:43.030
Wait—what's going on?

29:43.920 --> 29:44.960
You're leaving too?

29:44.960 --> 29:45.590
Chief Qi,

29:46.510 --> 29:47.350
I really can't stay

29:47.350 --> 29:48.350
in Sanjiangkou anymore.

29:48.350 --> 29:48.790
Wait.

29:49.350 --> 29:50.160
What are you talking about?

29:50.160 --> 29:51.350
How does this have to do with you?

29:51.350 --> 29:52.070
It does.

29:52.550 --> 29:53.440
Actually,

29:54.270 --> 29:55.640
Chief Zhang's second injury

29:55.640 --> 29:56.800
was caused by me.

29:57.350 --> 29:59.810
I'm consumed with guilt
and self-reproach.

30:00.030 --> 30:01.160
It was my own fault.

30:01.270 --> 30:02.130
I was careless.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.820
I can't forgive myself for it.

30:03.960 --> 30:05.440
So I've decided—I'm going back

30:05.440 --> 30:08.100
to the Provincial Department
with Chief Zhang.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.510
I will personally report my mistake
to Director Gao.

30:10.510 --> 30:11.030
No need.

30:11.190 --> 30:11.720
I insist!

30:11.960 --> 30:13.160
Wherever you go, I go.

30:13.270 --> 30:14.330
If you stay, I stay.

30:14.480 --> 30:17.790
I should take responsibility
for taking care of you until you recover.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.640
You stay in Sanjiangkou

30:18.640 --> 30:19.350
and focus on improving yourself.

30:19.350 --> 30:21.480
Trust me—this is a great opportunity.

30:23.750 --> 30:24.480
Come back...

30:24.830 --> 30:25.350
Chief Zhang,

30:25.350 --> 30:26.480
why are you so stubborn?

30:26.480 --> 30:27.750
You're not going anywhere.

30:27.750 --> 30:28.690
What's going on...

30:28.690 --> 30:29.820
We know everything.

30:32.110 --> 30:32.750
Know what?

30:34.030 --> 30:34.830
Catching Li Feng—

30:34.830 --> 30:36.630
you planned that from the start.

30:36.720 --> 30:38.160
The citywide DUI crackdown

30:38.160 --> 30:39.000
wasn't a bad call.

30:39.000 --> 30:40.260
It was a masterstroke.

30:40.440 --> 30:41.110
You'd already spotted the flaws

30:41.110 --> 30:42.380
in Chief Lu's case,

30:42.440 --> 30:43.040
right?

30:44.160 --> 30:45.720
You're always one step ahead of us,

30:45.720 --> 30:46.920
but you won't tell us—

30:46.920 --> 30:47.730
am I right?

30:48.110 --> 30:48.720
Yi'ang,

30:49.310 --> 30:50.240
just admit it.

30:51.440 --> 30:52.240
Admit what?

30:52.640 --> 30:53.200
Admit that you

30:53.200 --> 30:54.160
arranged all of this.

30:54.160 --> 30:54.590
Chief.

30:56.590 --> 30:57.850
I'm a straight talker.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.000
I'm a straight talker.

30:59.000 --> 31:00.260
I say things straight.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.460
I know

31:01.480 --> 31:03.680
you've got your reasons for doing this,

31:04.070 --> 31:05.830
but Ye Jian was like
a big brother to me.

31:05.830 --> 31:07.160
Anyone who'd dare
touch him in Sanjiangkou

31:07.160 --> 31:08.150
isn't ordinary.

31:08.550 --> 31:09.870
I know my limits.

31:10.030 --> 31:12.290
If we want to crack this case,
we need you.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.210
I'm asking you—

31:13.440 --> 31:14.170
please stay.

31:15.070 --> 31:15.550
Yi'ang,

31:16.230 --> 31:17.160
logically speaking,

31:17.160 --> 31:18.070
you're injured,

31:18.070 --> 31:20.410
and we should respect your decision,

31:20.590 --> 31:21.030
right?

31:21.160 --> 31:23.670
But the whole department needs you.

31:23.750 --> 31:24.720
We all need you.

31:25.160 --> 31:25.770
Stay.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.840
Please stay.

31:27.000 --> 31:27.730
Chief Zhang,

31:28.000 --> 31:29.680
we truly need your experience,

31:29.680 --> 31:30.790
your judgment, and your methods here.

31:30.790 --> 31:31.520
She's right—

31:31.830 --> 31:33.540
we mainly need your mind.

31:33.720 --> 31:34.440
How about this:

31:34.440 --> 31:35.270
you stay,

31:35.310 --> 31:36.200
and I'll find you a hospital

31:36.200 --> 31:36.960
to treat your leg,

31:36.960 --> 31:37.490
alright?

31:37.510 --> 31:38.630
You can command from behind the scenes.

31:38.630 --> 31:39.510
What do you think?

31:39.510 --> 31:40.440
Let me be your left hand.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.310
Let me be your right hand.

31:41.310 --> 31:42.200
Let me be your legs.

31:42.200 --> 31:43.070
I, uh...

31:43.070 --> 31:44.480
We've run out of body parts, Chief.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.960
I'll call Director Gao

31:45.960 --> 31:46.960
and get his approval right now—

31:46.960 --> 31:47.400
okay?

31:47.750 --> 31:49.010
That's not necessary.

31:49.750 --> 31:50.480
Chief Zhang—

31:50.720 --> 31:51.720
your legs are better?

31:51.720 --> 31:52.590
So you're staying?

31:52.590 --> 31:54.510
What's the spirit of the police force?

31:54.510 --> 31:55.780
What's a key officer?

31:56.550 --> 31:57.720
This is exactly the kind of talent

31:57.720 --> 31:59.000
our bureau needs.

31:59.400 --> 32:00.600
You're right, Chief.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.720
"A master detective"?

32:05.720 --> 32:06.450
Chief Zhang,

32:06.880 --> 32:09.160
Sanjiangkou really can't do without you.

32:09.160 --> 32:09.960
With you here,

32:10.920 --> 32:13.380
we'll surely clear the fog
and see the truth.

32:18.590 --> 32:19.590
Looks like

32:20.160 --> 32:22.360
I'm not leaving Sanjiangkou after all.

32:41.800 --> 32:42.700
[Sanjiangkou Master Detective:
Cunning Schemes to Crack the Mystery Case]

32:42.870 --> 32:43.700
[New Deputy Police Chief Zhang Yiang
Captures Serial Killer]

32:46.160 --> 32:47.510
Fifteen murders...

32:48.200 --> 32:50.060
how many death sentences is that?

32:50.480 --> 32:52.080
Let's not discuss work here.

32:54.400 --> 32:56.550
Isn't that the guy
from the elevator the other day?

32:56.550 --> 32:57.610
He is Zhang Yi'ang?

33:00.750 --> 33:01.720
He's only been here a few days

33:01.720 --> 33:02.880
and already caught a killer

33:02.880 --> 33:04.080
with 15 bodies on him.

33:04.880 --> 33:06.080
Pretty capable, huh.

33:06.160 --> 33:09.220
Li Feng, an A-level wanted suspect,
has been arrested.

33:13.130 --> 33:14.200
Didn't you say Fei brought

33:14.200 --> 33:15.350
in a heavy hitter?
What was his name?

33:15.350 --> 33:16.000
Li Feng.

33:20.830 --> 33:22.630
Zhang Yi'ang's got some skills.

33:23.160 --> 33:24.960
I'd like to meet him.

33:26.720 --> 33:28.030
Meeting a cop—

33:28.160 --> 33:30.270
won't that be a bit too high-profile?

33:30.790 --> 33:31.720
If he's capable of getting to the truth

33:31.720 --> 33:32.550
behind Ye's death,

33:32.550 --> 33:34.000
then of course I want to meet him.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.310
If he's not,

33:35.510 --> 33:36.310
there's no need for us

33:36.310 --> 33:37.170
to keep hiding.

33:38.590 --> 33:40.990
Mr. Rong, good thing
you had the foresight.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.340
Fei's line is already cut—

33:43.960 --> 33:45.560
no one can trace it back to us.

33:46.440 --> 33:47.590
What about Li Penggai?

33:47.590 --> 33:50.510
You could give him ten lives
and he still wouldn't try it.

33:50.510 --> 33:52.970
Tell him not to show up
at the company for now.

33:54.200 --> 33:54.730
Jianren,

33:55.880 --> 33:57.410
he's been with us for years—

33:57.720 --> 33:59.160
don't let him feel slighted,

33:59.160 --> 34:00.920
and don't give anyone reason
to get suspicious.

34:00.920 --> 34:02.180
Don't worry, Mr. Rong.

34:13.510 --> 34:14.320
That's the situation

34:14.320 --> 34:15.440
at the moment.

34:18.110 --> 34:18.840
But Jianren,

34:19.760 --> 34:20.360
why?

34:21.480 --> 34:22.510
The cops chased me

34:22.880 --> 34:23.840
like I was a dog

34:26.000 --> 34:27.710
when I was handling the task
for the company.

34:27.710 --> 34:30.840
Even if I didn't get results,
at least I put in the effort.

34:32.770 --> 34:33.429
Jianren...

34:34.510 --> 34:35.070
wait,

34:36.230 --> 34:38.090
this isn't a send-off meal, is it?

34:41.880 --> 34:42.679
Step outside.

34:55.360 --> 34:56.290
What do you know?

34:56.960 --> 34:59.490
The company's planning
to put you to good use.

35:00.110 --> 35:01.110
Put me to good use?

35:01.440 --> 35:02.030
Then why are you sending me

35:02.030 --> 35:04.030
to a construction site to haul sand?

35:04.190 --> 35:04.930
Jianren,

35:05.000 --> 35:06.400
I didn't get much schooling—

35:06.400 --> 35:07.800
just be straight with me.

35:08.110 --> 35:08.960
If I've done anything wrong, I'll fix it.

35:08.960 --> 35:09.440
I, Li Penggai,

35:09.440 --> 35:10.840
I-I can change anything.

35:12.050 --> 35:13.240
I swear...

35:13.840 --> 35:15.550
You know how big companies

35:15.550 --> 35:16.410
and corporates

35:16.480 --> 35:17.960
train people these days?

35:19.320 --> 35:21.000
You start at the bottom.

35:21.630 --> 35:23.240
Work your way up.

35:24.150 --> 35:24.680
Way up...

35:28.190 --> 35:30.510
When heaven is about to entrust someone
with great responsibility,

35:30.510 --> 35:32.190
it first brings suffering to...

35:32.190 --> 35:32.590
and labor to...

35:32.590 --> 35:33.630
Anyway, that's the idea.

35:33.630 --> 35:34.230
You get it?

35:35.030 --> 35:35.920
This is Mr. Rong

35:35.920 --> 35:37.380
looking out for you.

35:37.590 --> 35:39.650
Short-term pain for long-term gain.

35:42.000 --> 35:42.860
So, Jianren...

35:42.880 --> 35:43.190
Jianren.

35:43.190 --> 35:45.250
It's not that I lack confidence,

35:45.440 --> 35:46.550
I just want to ask—

35:46.920 --> 35:49.110
Rongcheng Group's full
of talented people,

35:49.110 --> 35:51.640
so why am I the one
getting this "honor" first?

35:53.230 --> 35:53.760
Exactly—

35:56.030 --> 35:56.920
think about it.

35:58.230 --> 35:59.560
Yeah, think it through.

36:00.000 --> 36:01.400
You need to use your head.

36:04.960 --> 36:05.660
You want me to...

36:05.660 --> 36:06.660
to... go to

36:06.840 --> 36:08.170
a construction site...

36:09.670 --> 36:10.380
I can...

36:13.710 --> 36:15.370
Jianren, I've figured it out—

36:16.000 --> 36:16.800
you mean

36:17.630 --> 36:19.160
grooming me as a successor?

36:20.150 --> 36:21.150
Mr. Rong wants

36:21.230 --> 36:22.840
to train me to take over—

36:33.280 --> 36:35.880
Ye's memorial is tomorrow?

36:36.920 --> 36:38.550
That's what the notice says.

36:41.190 --> 36:42.120
Spread the word—

36:42.230 --> 36:43.830
have the guys all
go see Ye off

36:44.150 --> 36:45.230
one last time.

36:55.430 --> 37:03.290
[In Deepest Mourning of Comrade Ye Jian]

37:15.440 --> 37:19.010
[In Deepest Mourning of Comrade Ye Jian]

37:39.430 --> 37:44.940
[In Deepest Mourning of Comrade Ye Jian]

37:48.630 --> 37:49.480
Make sure the family
is fully taken care of.

37:49.480 --> 37:49.940
Yes, Sir.

37:49.940 --> 37:50.480
Right?

37:50.920 --> 37:51.670
You two...

37:51.760 --> 37:52.490
Understood.

38:10.630 --> 38:11.360
Who are they?

38:11.920 --> 38:13.480
The one in the middle—the tallest—

38:13.480 --> 38:14.210
is Zhou Rong,

38:14.960 --> 38:15.670
a real estate developer,

38:15.670 --> 38:17.270
the boss of Rongcheng Group.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.630
The one on the left with glasses

38:18.630 --> 38:19.400
is Hu Jianren,

38:19.400 --> 38:20.190
his right-hand man,

38:20.190 --> 38:21.800
executive assistant at Rongcheng Group.

38:21.800 --> 38:23.510
The one on the right,
with long hair and a beard—

38:23.510 --> 38:24.800
the one who looks shady—

38:24.800 --> 38:25.860
that's Lang Bowen.

38:26.150 --> 38:26.760
And the one behind them,

38:26.760 --> 38:27.880
a bit shorter,

38:27.880 --> 38:29.000
is Lu Yibo,

38:29.400 --> 38:31.110
manager of the Fenglinwan Hotel—

38:31.110 --> 38:33.040
the biggest hotel in Sanjiangkou.

38:56.070 --> 38:57.400
What does Lang Bowen do?

38:58.070 --> 38:59.370
He owns Aotu Company—

38:59.480 --> 39:01.550
he works with Zhou Rong in real estate.

39:01.550 --> 39:02.800
Zhou Rong handles land acquisition;

39:02.800 --> 39:04.400
he handles demolition and construction.

39:04.400 --> 39:05.150
The two companies

39:05.150 --> 39:07.630
operate upstream
and downstream of each other.

39:07.630 --> 39:09.190
And that kid is Lang Botu,

39:09.440 --> 39:11.170
Lang Bowen's younger brother.

39:19.110 --> 39:21.910
How... how come he doesn't
even look like himself?

39:23.030 --> 39:23.510
Get up.

39:29.440 --> 39:30.630
Why would Ye

39:30.630 --> 39:31.830
be mixed up with them?

39:31.920 --> 39:33.180
They grew up together—

39:33.190 --> 39:34.390
hang out all the time.

39:34.920 --> 39:37.150
Normally, Ye should've kept his distance

39:37.150 --> 39:38.280
to avoid suspicion,

39:38.710 --> 39:39.590
but he never

39:39.590 --> 39:40.710
bothered.

39:42.190 --> 39:44.630
He's gone cold...

39:45.190 --> 39:46.310
Ye Jian!

39:46.340 --> 39:48.550
Wake up! Ye Jian!

39:48.710 --> 39:50.070
Why are you so cold?

39:51.070 --> 39:52.640
Chief Lu had it looked into before,

39:52.640 --> 39:54.100
but after digging into it,

39:54.190 --> 39:55.480
they found no business dealings

39:55.480 --> 39:56.610
between Ye and them.

39:57.230 --> 39:58.510
Financially, everything was clean—

39:58.510 --> 39:59.840
they were just friends.

40:00.000 --> 40:02.650
Call him! Cakk him now!

40:02.960 --> 40:04.030
Call him!

40:04.030 --> 40:06.840
Wake him up—call him!

40:07.670 --> 40:09.700
Don't drag me—

40:09.840 --> 40:11.030
call him!

40:11.030 --> 40:12.110
Ye knew what he was doing.

40:12.110 --> 40:13.630
Call him! Call him!

40:13.760 --> 40:15.800
You call him! Jian!

40:16.230 --> 40:18.090
Jian! Jian!

40:31.510 --> 40:32.240
Chief Zhang.

40:32.710 --> 40:33.190
Hello.

40:38.110 --> 40:39.160
This is my card—

40:39.550 --> 40:40.150
Zhou Rong.

40:41.590 --> 40:41.950
[Zhou Rong, Chairman]

40:42.390 --> 40:42.770
[Rongcheng]

40:42.800 --> 40:43.800
I saw the report

40:44.230 --> 40:45.280
about you catching a fugitive

40:45.280 --> 40:46.800
with 15 murders on him.

40:47.670 --> 40:49.320
They're calling you a master detective.

40:49.320 --> 40:51.450
I'm counting on you for Ye Jian's case—

40:52.230 --> 40:52.960
please,

40:53.760 --> 40:55.760
whatever it takes, find the killer.

40:55.800 --> 40:57.460
If you need anything, call me—

40:58.110 --> 40:58.970
anytime, 24/7.

40:59.190 --> 40:59.720
Alright.

41:00.480 --> 41:01.070
I can see

41:01.280 --> 41:02.070
you mean it.

41:03.590 --> 41:04.510
Catching the killer—

41:04.510 --> 41:05.670
that's our job,

41:06.670 --> 41:07.630
no matter who the victim was.
